<section class="wrap py-16" aria-labelledby="lab-faq"><div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr]"><div><h2 id="lab-faq" class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-ink-900">Frequently asked questions</h2><p class="mt-3 text-ink-700">Clear answers regarding our laboratory certifications and quality standards.</p></div><div class="divide-y divide-line border-y border-line"><details name="faq" class="group"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 py-5 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><h3 class="text-lg leading-snug font-semibold">Why do we test our ghee in independent labs?</h3><span class="mt-1 shrink-0 rounded-full border border-ink-200 p-1 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="size-4" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="max-w-[68ch] pb-6 text-ink-800">We believe trust is earned through transparency. Every batch is tested at an accredited laboratory to verify milk fat purity, moisture control, and the complete absence of vanaspati or vegetable oils.</p></details><details name="faq" class="group"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 py-5 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><h3 class="text-lg leading-snug font-semibold">How can I view or download the lab report?</h3><span class="mt-1 shrink-0 rounded-full border border-ink-200 p-1 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="size-4" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="max-w-[68ch] pb-6 text-ink-800">Click either 'View Lab Report' to read the full high-resolution PDF in your browser, or 'Download Report (PDF)' to save a copy. You can also scan the QR code printed on the back of any Farm Dip jar.</p></details><details name="faq" class="group"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 py-5 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><h3 class="text-lg leading-snug font-semibold">What adulterants do lab tests check for?</h3><span class="mt-1 shrink-0 rounded-full border border-ink-200 p-1 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="size-4" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="max-w-[68ch] pb-6 text-ink-800">Tests screen for vegetable oils (vanaspati), plant sterols, mineral oils, synthetic colouring agents, animal tallow, and excess moisture.</p></details><details name="faq" class="group"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 py-5 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><h3 class="text-lg leading-snug font-semibold">Is Farm Dip pure desi buffalo ghee certified by FSSAI?</h3><span class="mt-1 shrink-0 rounded-full border border-ink-200 p-1 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="size-4" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="max-w-[68ch] pb-6 text-ink-800">Yes, Farm Dip operates under FSSAI licence number {{ settings.fssai }}, strictly following national food safety standards.</p></details></div></div></section>

